<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:39.330
Masaru, a new Digimon has appeared.

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:41.910
Yeah, he was born at my house!

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:44.590
He's called Piyomon, and he gets along really well with Chika!

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:45.930
Why are you acting so calm about this?

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:49.510
Anyone who becomes partners with a Digimon must join DATS!

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:50.760
What?

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:53.140
I can't let Chika get involved in battles...

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:55.680
I'll force Piyomon back to the Digital World!

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:57.180
Digimon Savers:

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:58.520
I will Protect Chika!

00:22:58.520 --> 00:22:59.920
Piyomon's Resolve!

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:02.160
Awaken in my fist, Digisoul!

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.170
I will Protect Chika!

